Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Signed-off-by: Guido Günther <agx@sigxcpu.org>
Applied-upstream: gnome-shell 49.4, commit:d0e1664ac6278b70a7e26bf8135f0d1d92ee1e9f
